    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Talk: <b>Wed Oct 7</b>, session "Learning &amp; Tutoring" (chair: Tomás Reyes). 15 min + 5 Q&amp;A. TutorTrace.</div><div>AV check with Tomás on Zoom was 10/2 — 16:9, HDMI at the podium, they provide a clicker but bring mine.</div><div><br/></div><h3>Talk stuff</h3><div><en-todo checked="true"/>laptop + charger</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>USB-C -&gt; HDMI adapter AND USB-C -&gt; USB-C (some podiums have USB-C now)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>my clicker + spare AAA</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>slides as PDF on a USB stick (backup if the laptop dies)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>slides + demo video in Drive, offline-available</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>demo video as standalone mp4 (don't rely on embedded video in Keynote)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>printed speaker notes (1 page, big font)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>conference badge QR (email from registration)</div><h3>Clothes</h3><div><en-todo checked="true"/>1 nicer shirt for the talk day, 2 casual</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>running kit x2 (keep the streak through taper-ish week; half is Oct 15)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>light jacket</div><h3>Misc</h3><div><en-todo checked="true"/>business cards? -&gt; Mathetic ones arrived 9/30, take 30</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>poster tube - no poster this time</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>reimbursement: keep ALL receipts (VT travel funding approved, Grace says itemized receipts within 10 days)</div><div><br/></div><div>10/5: packed. rehearsed the opening twice more. remember: 80 seconds max before the first figure.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
